Brought to you by Kingdom Events

This is our brand new 6-week skating experience designed to help beginners and improvers build confidence, improve their skills, and truly enjoy the Roller Praise Party events even more.

\
**What makes this programme special?**\
This is not just skate lessons, it’s a Full Skating Experience and you keep everything included in the package so you can continue skating and practicing in your own time

##### Your £225 all-inclusive package includes:

- 6 Weekly Interactive Skate Sessions\
  Six 75-minute coached classes designed to build your confidence step by step. (£150 Value)

- Pro Ventro Roller Skates\
  Your own pair of premium skates with customised wheels that you keep. (£135+ Value)\

- Ventro Skate Bag\
  Perfect for carrying your skates to events and sessions. (£30 Value)\

- Skate Socks\
  (£10 Value)\

- Full Protective Gear\
  • Pro Helmet • Elbow Pads • Wrist Guards • Knee Pads (£80 Value)\

- Branded Personalised Water Bottle\
  (£25 Value)\

- Prayer Journal\
  (£15 Value)\

- Certificate of Completion\
  (PRICELESS!!)\

- Complimentary Entry to a Roller Praise Party Event\
  (£25 Value)

Once you purchase your ticket you will receive an email requesting for your Skate Size, Skate Wheel Colour choice, Helmet Size and Skate Protective Gear Size. \
You will also receive a courtesy call to confirm your order has been complete so ***please ensure you enter a valid contact number.***\
